  << /ActualText (XShield Tints \nRepositioning a Local Business\nProduct Designer \046 Researcher\054 Freelance \n2025 \023 Present \050ongoing\051\n\nRepositioned a Surrey tinting company beyond automotive into the residential and commercial markets\073 sales increased with the expansion\056\nGrounded the work in ethnographic research with two days of field observation\054 interviews with five clients\054 and a participatory design workshop with the business owner\056\nRan a regional brand competitive analysis\054 designed three brand directions\054 and delivered the full rebrand and a live CMS\055based website\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
