1646 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Led the design of digital products from discovery through implementation\054 collaborating with product managers\054 developers\054 and stakeholders to deliver user\055centered web and mobile experiences\056\nDefined product strategy through competitive analysis\054 stakeholder workshops\054 user research\054 personas\054 and information architecture\056\nDesigned end\055to\055end user experiences\054 including user flows\054 wireframes\054 interactive prototypes\054 and high\055fidelity interfaces for web and mobile applications\056\nBuilt scalable design systems\054 reusable UI components\054 and accessibility standards to improve consistency across products\056\nConducted usability testing and behavioral analysis using Hotjar\054 FullStory\054 Google Analytics\054 and A\057B testing to validate design decisions\056\nCollaborated with cross\055functional Agile teams throughout the product lifecycle\054 ensuring accurate developer handoff with Figma Dev Mode\056\nMentored designers\054 led design critiques\054 and established UX best practices across the team\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1647 0 R
     /Pg 1630 0 R
     /S /Span
