  << /ActualText (Flow\nBeacon\055Based Indoor Navigation System\nUX Designer \046 Researcher\nSimon Fraser University 2026\n\nAddressed an accessibility gap in building infrastructure\072 KONE destination elevators rely on touch screens\054 which are inaccessible to blind and partially sighted users\056\nConceptualized the system architecture connecting BLE beacons\054 a mobile app\054 and the KONE destination elevator API into one continuous\054 hands\055free experience\056\nDesigned a non\055visual interaction model using audio prompts and a haptic pulse language for indoor wayfinding\054 grounded in peer\055reviewed accessibility research\056)
